  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">St&#xF6;d till Arm&#xE9;museum i Sthlm i samband med utst&#xE4;llningen &quot;Barn och Krig&quot; som kommer att h&#xE5;llas i Stockholm november 2004 - juni 2005 samt ink&#xF6;p av &quot;The Chair of the African King&quot;. St&#xF6;det inkluderar &#xE4;ven ett seminarium i Stockholm p&#xE5; temat &quot;Betydelsen av kultur f&#xF6;r utveckling av demokrati&quot; avsedda f&#xF6;r bist&#xE5;ndsarbetare, politiker, journalister och kulturarbetare.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to the Army Museum in Stockholm in connection to the exhibition &quot;Children and War&quot; held in Stockholm November, 2004 - June, 2005 and purchase of &quot;The Chair of the African King&quot;. The support also includes a seminar in Stockholm on &quot;The importance of Culture for the development of Democracy for assistance workers, politicians, journalists and culture workers.</narrative>
  </description>
